@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN
@adminToken = YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN
@userId = YOUR_USER_ID

# Auth: cookie OR Bearer - server checks Cookie first, then Bearer
# Use either: Cookie: token={{token}} OR Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get My Usage (auth required - cookie OR Bearer)
GET {{baseUrl}}/usage
Cookie: token={{token}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reset Usage For User (auth + admin - cookie OR Bearer)
POST {{baseUrl}}/usage/reset/{{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: token={{adminToken}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Reset All Usage (auth + admin - cookie OR Bearer)
POST {{baseUrl}}/usage/reset-all
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: token={{adminToken}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
